== Read-only root-cause reproduction (curl to serving backend) ==
valid token, NO fcm_token (mimics logout dispatchTokenClear body {_method:put,token}) -> HTTP 403
valid token WITH fcm_token (mimics login/updateToken)                                  -> HTTP 200
empty token, with fcm_token (the race path the fix targets, DmTokenIsValid)            -> HTTP 401

== Backend cause ==
DeliverymanController@update_fcm_token: Validator 'fcm_token'=>'required'; fails -> response 403.
dispatchTokenClear() posts {"_method":"put","token":userToken} with NO fcm_token -> deterministic 403 on every logout/notif-off.
Pre-fix (commit 7e3bc718) clearSharedData/setNotificationActive already omitted fcm_token -> 403 is pre-existing; the NEARS-1447 guard only prevents the empty-token 401 path.
